sequenceDiagram
    title Checkout
    box Client side
    participant B as Browser
    end
    box rgb(240,240,255) Services
    participant C as Cart
    participant P as Payments
    end
    B->>C: Add item
    C->>P: Authorize card
    P--xC: Declined
    break when the card is declined
        C-->>B: Show error
    end
